  "goodToKnow": "Anprangern means to denounce or publicly condemn: Missstände, Ungerechtigkeit, Korruption anprangern. It comes from der Pranger, the pillory where offenders were publicly shamed in the Middle Ages; jemanden an den Pranger stellen still means to pillory someone. Many old town halls still have their Pranger posts. Separable: prangerte an, angeprangert."
